<title>UK: BAe finalises buy of 49 pct of STN Atlas.</title>
<headline>BAe finalises buy of 49 pct of STN Atlas.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Aerospace Plc said on Wednesday it had yesterday signed a consortium deal with German partners Rheinmetall AG and Badenwerk AG to acquire former Bremer Vulkan unit STN Atlas Electronik.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the agreement, British Aerospace will acquire a 49 percent interest in the naval systems integration business for about 270 million marks, or 104 million stg, cash in line with terms of the deal announced earlier this month.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
